  title="Shots That Shield Your Ears: Vaccines That Quietly Protect Hearing"
  description="Some infections can steal hearing for good. The right vaccines lower that risk—quietly and powerfully. Here’s the evidence, the shortlist of shots with ear-protective impact, and how to build a practical plan with your doctor or pharmacist."
